a","Food"],"is_open":true},"evidence":{"source":"frozen-model","summary":{"business_id":"6XZlRSgdUsEDPlYurRgpMw","user_id":"D76EFdD5F7XoIIyQmWTQhA","user_row":3279,"nv_rank":887,"mm_rank":774,"target_category_support_fraction":1.0,"selected_image_count":4,"label_diversity":2,"target_visual_score_gain":null,"target_visual_rank_gain":null,"competitive_visual_rank_effect":null},"category_overlap":[{"category":"Coffee & Tea","historical_business_count":1},{"category":"Food","historical_business_count":3}],"history":[{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Coffee & Tea, Food","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"6XZlRSgdUsEDPlYurRgpMw","review_id":"-JtZaocCyghTqeKFM1_4PQ","date":"2016-10-28T02:34:46","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9439172744750977,"text_excerpt":"I'm probably one of the few folks in the city for whom Sacred Grinds is the closest coffeeshop to my office. I love working in the cemeteries (ok, in an office in the cemeteries), and Sacred Grinds is a big part of what makes working there so special. I'm not a fan of the over-used phrase \"only in New Orleans,\" but I mean... only in New Orleans. It's a coffee shop in a head shop in a cemetery. And it's zombie themed. Here's some of the things I love about it: -the staff! Thank you for being so nice to me all these years. -they cold brew their own coffee and chai -lots of vegan options (I'm not, but hey, if I'm going to constantly buy mini muffins, at least they're healthy) -almond milk! a..."},{"business_id":"6XZlRSgdUsEDPlYurRgpMw","review_id":"cpjSAU4rzrQkbZjmt5CpGg","date":"2016-03-16T16:40:23","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9341779351234436,"text_excerpt":"The coffee is great. They have a punch card rewards program. The food is limited but good for a coffee shop. Note: I am not a pastry person, so I am not speaking about the sweeter items. There is an adjoining smoke shop and store, which is cool. My favorite part about this place is the small outdoor seating area overlooking the graveyard. Some may call it creepy, but i find it so peaceful to write here. It's quiet. The internet is good."},{"business_id":"6XZlRSgdUsEDPlYurRgpMw","review_id":"ySUwD3enO0cSOyo_fgdIlw","date":"2012-12-22T21:47:35","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9316710233688354,"text_excerpt":"After having been in the states for 3 weeks now, and having made a concerted effort to find really good coffee, i would have to say that Sacred Grinds is the best I've had so far. They also have a really good array of snacks available, the chorizo quiche in particular is delicious. There's a small outdoor seating area at the back that's adjacent to the cemetery, providing cool views. There is also more seating out the front with some cool zombie hand chairs. Definitely recommend this place for anyone that enjoys a solid espresso coffee. Prices are good too."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"6XZlRSgdUsEDPlYurRgpMw","photo_id":"fVat6H_PkQHUnJ_7Czskbg","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/fVat6H_PkQHUnJ_7Czskbg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9429581165313721},{"business_id":"6XZlRSgdUsEDPlYurRgpMw","photo_id":"ZfFopa1iq2WtcgxJBwTyWw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/ZfFopa1iq2WtcgxJBwTyWw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8766027092933655},{"business_id":"6XZlRSgdUsEDPlYurRgpMw","photo_id":"S1_uFFQZfIcyrQSkJ9_hIg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/S1_uFFQZfIcyrQSkJ9_hIg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8288277387619019},{"business_id":"6XZlRSgdUsEDPlYurRgpMw","photo_id":"Z0gXCNCUlrWV-w_57BTldA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Z0gXCNCUlrWV-w_57BTldA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.6794837713241577}]},"notebook_case":null}
